// Punk: eighth-note root line on the E and A strings, open strings between position shifts,
// a swung triplet pickup into bar 8, repeated notes, and the bass entering after six bars of
// band. Original material written for evaluation (no copyright issue). The guitar and drum
// tracks are not part of the truth; they give the beat tracker a band to listen to.
\title "Punk Eighths"
\tempo 152
.
